<div class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">PERSONAL JOURNAL</p><h1>個人日誌<span class="english-heading">A little outside the lab.</span></h1><p class="lead">工作裡的練習、旅途中的見聞，<br>還有那些想先寫下來，再慢慢理解的事。</p></div>
<div class="topic-grid journal-grid">{% for topic in topics %}{% if topic.section == 'journal' %}<a class="topic-card" href="{{ topic.path | url }}"><div class="topic-top"><span>{{ topic.number }}</span><span>{{ (collections.articles | inTopic(topic.id)).length }} 篇文章</span></div><h2>{{ topic.name }}</h2><p class="topic-english">{{ topic.english }}</p><p>{{ topic.description }}</p></a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
<section class="latest-section"><div class="section-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">RECENT ENTRIES</p><h2>最近的日誌</h2></div></div>{% set articleList = collections.articles | inSection('journal') | latest(6) %}{% include 'article-list.njk' %}</section>
